WEBVTT

00:10:29.833 --> 00:10:31.293
Can we clear Tchaikovsky?

00:10:31.377 --> 00:10:32.378
(Laughter)

00:10:34.254 --> 00:10:36.924
Will we see twerking
as an Olympic sport one day?

00:10:38.133 --> 00:10:40.135
And will Black people still be part of it?

00:10:41.553 --> 00:10:43.472
I’m proud to be a twerk pioneer.

00:10:44.056 --> 00:10:46.475
I’m grateful for the asses
that came before me.

00:10:46.934 --> 00:10:47.976
(Laughter)

00:10:48.936 --> 00:10:50.187
All hail Beyoncé.

00:10:50.896 --> 00:10:52.106
Nicki Minaj.

00:10:52.773 --> 00:10:54.608
From Betty Boop to Buffie the Body.

00:10:54.858 --> 00:10:56.026
When I shake this ass,

00:10:56.026 --> 00:10:57.903
I do it for the culture,

00:10:57.903 --> 00:10:58.904
not the vulture.

00:10:59.697 --> 00:11:01.990
For me, twerking ain’t a trend.